            "review_title": "Review at Bromance & Beer Restaurant",
            "review_text": "mpenel0pe\nParis, France107 contributions\n0\nCouldn’t look for a better place in Hanoi !\nJul 2017 • Couples\nWe found this restaurant randomly walking near the river. It is a typical, trendy and charming restaurant with a view on the river. We had a Vietnamian fondu with beers and everything was very good. A bit expensive compared to the street restaurants and snacks you can find in the area but definitely a good value for money ! I warmly recommend this restaurant !\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 23, 2018",
