            "review_title": "Review at Bromance & Beer Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Sharkgrl86\nSan Diego, California110 contributions\n0\nBromance It Is\nJan 2018 • Couples\nThe name of this place alone made us stop in for a beer. My boyfriend is very close with his guy friends so we had to take pictures to send back to them. We mainly we're killing time before our dinner plans so we only ordered beer and some appetizers. Saigon Special beer was our choice & it came to the table good and cold. If you're ordering food I highly recommend the Fried Corn. It battered corn fried up to perfection. Add a little chili sauce on it and you'll be in heaven. The fries as well were very crispy and well seasoned. Stop by for good food, cold beer and lots of laughs.\nRead more\nWritten January 31, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
