            "review_title": "Review at Bromance & Beer Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Jason T\n4 contributions\n0\nbeer with a view\nJul 2016 • Friends\nA new place on the north shore of Truc Bach lake, B&B offers a selection of bottled domestic and imports, local draught beer, and good food to boot. The special is seasoned dried beef, which you roll up in large dark green leaves and dip in a spicy sauce - perfect with beer. The hotpot is also good, but the highlight is drinking beer with buddies, catchy music, and gazing across the lake.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 1, 2016",
